        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "1ec1a4e9-2b83-5f33-ba31-3566b697884b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Trick-Trick, Proof, Obie Trice, Miz Korona, Jazze Pha, Kon Artis, Eminem, Diezel\n- Groups: D12, Goon Sqwad\n- Products: The People vs., The Villain, “Welcome 2 Detroit”\n- Places: Detroit, Michigan\n\nFacts:\n- DeShaun Dupree Holton, known as Proof, was born on October 2, 1973, and died on April 11, 2006.\n- Proof was an American rapper and actor from Detroit, Michigan.\n- “Welcome 2 Detroit” was the lead single from Trick-Trick’s debut studio album, The People vs.\n- The People vs. featured guest appearances by Obie Trice, Miz Korona, Jazze Pha, Proof, Kon Artis, Eminem, and Diezel.\n- Proof, Kon Artis, and Eminem were members of D12.\n- Diezel was Trick-Trick’s brother and his bandmate in Goon Sqwad.\n- The Villain was the second studio album by American rapper Trick-Trick.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
